SUMMARY:Thom Tran
LOCATION:The Stand Up Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Some comedians kill onstage. Thom Tran has survived considerabl
 
y worse.A U.S. Army combat veteran and Purple Heart recipient\, Tran turned
 
 to stand-up after a sniper wound ended his military careerthen founded The
 
 GIs of Comedy\, which has performed around the world and raised more than 
 
$50\,000 for military families.Now hes trading combat boots for punchlines 
 
with sharp\, fearless comedy forged by someone who knows an actual bad day 
 
makes your terrible DoorDash experience sound adorable.Catch Thom Tran live
 
 and discover why hes performed everywhere from military bases to Hollywood
 
s biggest comedy clubs. Grab your tickets before they go AWOL. ************
 
